<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--primary)\"><path d=\"M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4\"></path></svg><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-right:8px\">Recevez les bons plans par email</span><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Votre email\" required=\"\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb);font-size:0.9rem\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--primary);color:white;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem\">OK</button></form></div><div class=\"article-content\"><div><p>\nCes soins coréens <strong>cassent Internet</strong> et sont devenus des <strong>incontournables</strong> de toute routine skincare. Voici les <strong>10 best sellers</strong> YesStyle que tout le monde s'arrache !</p><h2>1. COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence</h2><p>Le <strong>sérum le plus viral</strong> au monde. 96% de bave d'escargot pour une peau <strong>repulpée, lisse et éclatante</strong>. Hydratation intense, réparation de la barrière cutanée, anti-rougeurs. Le must-have absolu.</p><div class=\"product-card\"><span class=\"product-card-badge\">N°1 mondial</span><div class=\"product-card-info\"><strong class=\"product-card-name\">COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence</strong><p class=\"product-card-desc\">96% bave d'escargot. Hydratation, réparation, anti-rougeurs. Le sérum le plus viral au monde.</p><div class=\"product-card-rating\"><span class=\"product-card-stars\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.9/5</strong></div></div><div class=\"product-card-action\"><span class=\"product-card-price\">~18€</span><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div></div><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Shopper sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>2. Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner</h2><p>Le <strong>toner N°1 sur YesStyle</strong>. 77% d'extrait de houttuynia pour <strong>apaiser</strong>, réduire les rougeurs et <strong>équilibrer</strong> peaux grasses et sensibles. Texture aqueuse, absorption immédiate.</p><div class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-card-info\"><strong class=\"product-card-name\">Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner</strong><p class=\"product-card-desc\">77% houttuynia, apaise les rougeurs, équilibre peaux grasses et sensibles. Toner N°1 YesStyle.</p><div class=\"product-card-rating\"><span class=\"product-card-stars\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.8/5</strong></div></div><div class=\"product-card-action\"><span class=\"product-card-price\">~16€</span><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div></div><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>3. Beauty of Joseon Relief Sun SPF50+</h2><p>La <strong>crème solaire coréenne virale</strong>. Texture légère, <strong>zéro trace blanche</strong>, enrichie au riz et probiotiques. Protection UVA/UVB maximale. Se porte seule ou sous le maquillage.</p><div class=\"product-card\"><span class=\"product-card-badge\">Viral TikTok</span><div class=\"product-card-info\"><strong class=\"product-card-name\">Beauty of Joseon Relief Sun SPF50+</strong><p class=\"product-card-desc\">Solaire léger, zéro trace blanche, riz + probiotiques. Se porte sous le maquillage.</p><div class=\"product-card-rating\"><span class=\"product-card-stars\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.8/5</strong></div></div><div class=\"product-card-action\"><span class=\"product-card-price\">~12€</span><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div></div><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Shopper sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>4. SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule</h2><p>100% centella asiatica de Madagascar. <strong>Apaise, répare, cicatrise</strong>. Parfait pour les peaux sensibles, acnéiques ou irritées. Texture légère, pénètre instantanément.</p><div class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-card-info\"><strong class=\"product-card-name\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule</strong><p class=\"product-card-desc\">100% centella asiatica. Apaise, répare, cicatrise. Idéal peaux sensibles et acnéiques.</p><div class=\"product-card-rating\"><span class=\"product-card-stars\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.7/5</strong></div></div><div class=\"product-card-action\"><span class=\"product-card-price\">~15€</span><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div></div><h2>5. COSRX Acne Pimple Master Patch</h2><p>Les <strong>patchs anti-boutons</strong> que tout TikTok utilise. Hydrocolloïdes qui aspirent le pus en une nuit. Invisibles, discrets, <strong>redoutablement efficaces</strong>.</p><div class=\"product-card\"><span class=\"product-card-badge\">Petit prix</span><div class=\"product-card-info\"><strong class=\"product-card-name\">COSRX Acne Pimple Master Patch</strong><p class=\"product-card-desc\">Patchs hydrocolloïdes anti-boutons. Aspirent le pus en une nuit, invisibles et discrets.</p><div class=\"product-card-rating\"><span class=\"product-card-stars\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.9/5</strong></div></div><div class=\"product-card-action\"><span class=\"product-card-price\">~5€</span><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div></div><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-206\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>6. Beauty of Joseon Glow Serum Propolis + Niacinamide</h2><p>Sérum <strong>éclat et anti-pores</strong> au propolis et niacinamide. Donne un glow naturel, resserre les pores, unifie le teint. La peau <strong>brille de l'intérieur</strong>.</p><div class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-card-info\"><strong class=\"product-card-name\">Beauty of Joseon Glow Serum Propolis + Niacinamide</strong><p class=\"product-card-desc\">Sérum éclat au propolis + niacinamide. Glow naturel, pores resserrés, teint unifié.</p><div class=\"product-card-rating\"><span class=\"product-card-stars\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.7/5</strong></div></div><div class=\"product-card-action\"><span class=\"product-card-price\">~10€</span><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"