 Glutathione Glow Capsule Cream</h2><p>La crème <strong>anti-âge et éclat</strong> au glutathion. Technologie capsule pour une peau <strong>lumineuse et repulpée</strong>. La marque virale des appareils AGE-R.</p><div class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-card-info\"><strong class=\"product-card-name\">medicube AGE-R Glutathione Glow Capsule Cream</strong><p class=\"product-card-desc\">Crème anti-âge au glutathion, technologie capsule. Peau lumineuse et repulpée.</p><div class=\"product-card-rating\"><span class=\"product-card-stars\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.5/5</strong></div></div><div class=\"product-card-action\"><span class=\"product-card-price\">~25€</span><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div></div><h2>Récap des prix</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>#</th><th>Produit</th><th>Prix</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>COSRX Snail Mucin Essence</td>\n<td>~<strong>18€</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Anua Heartleaf Toner</td>\n<td>~<strong>16€</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Beauty of Joseon Sun SPF50+</td>\n<td>~<strong>12€</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>SKIN1004 Centella Ampoule</td>\n<td>~<strong>15€</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>COSRX Pimple Patches</td>\n<td>~<strong>5€</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Beauty of Joseon Glow Serum</td>\n<td>~<strong>10€</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Anua Niacinamide Serum</td>\n<td>~<strong>14€</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<